      "fact": "Four stacked bars are aligned to the x-axis labels May 09, May 08, May 06, and May 07 from left to right."
    },
    {
      "location": "May 06 bar",
      "fact": "The blue Station X segment is a thin base at the bottom of the stack, with the green Station Y segment directly above it and the orange Station Z segment forming the top."
    },
